# The full-strength (big-net) Stockfish 19 .wasm files (~99 MB each) are NOT
# committed as single files (GitHub refuses files > 100 MiB and warns > 50 MB;
# Cloudflare Pages refuses > 25 MiB). They are committed as the "engine pack":
# public/engine/pack/ (gzip chunks of 20 MiB + a 259 KB delta for the threaded
# build + engine-pack.json with SHA-256 checksums). See docs/ENGINE.md (v0.3).
# Recreate the single files locally (tests, benches, local Windows packaging):
#   node scripts/engine-pack.mjs assemble public/engine
stockfish-19-single.wasm
stockfish-19.wasm
